        "value": "threatened",
        "source": "elcat-v2024.1",
        "note": "Vigorous in a few families. Diminishing vigor at Isleta except among older adults. Commerce on tribal land, traditional ceremonial life. Only middle-aged or elderly are fluent but some younger people use the language and at least a few children acquire it (Golla 2007). Positive attitudes. [Endangerment.Certainty: 0.6]",
        "scale": "elcat-v2024.1"
      },
